OL,3,GNEWSAClarkson's Hawkstone Choir
OL,4,Areleases first single
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeremy Clarkson's Hawkstone Farmers'
OL,7,FChoir has released its first single,
OL,8,Fwith the song a "recognition of the
OL,9,Fdaily grind" farmers go through.
OL,11,FThe choir - which describes Clarkson as
OL,12,Fits "biggest cheerleader" - won
OL,13,FBritain's Got Talent earlier this year,
OL,14,Fand has since announced a nationwide
OL,15,Ftour and an album.
OL,17,FAbsolution, the first song from the
OL,18,Fdebut album, was released on Friday and
OL,19,Fexplores reconnecting with other
OL,20,Ffarmers in the often lonely agriculture
OL,21,Findustry.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
